{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.210.150.55","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79678,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aae5aca23e779a0d3710b4cab338a97c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Has anyone used DJ Encore? He is the only DJ that Juan Carlos can recommend for Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun but I cannot find any reviews on him. I have seen reviews for other DJ&#039;s used at our venue but none for their \"house DJ.\" Please feel free to leave any recommendations for other DJ&#039;s as well!&amp;nbsp; Our wedding is March 12, 2016 so any help ASAP would be amazing!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906801,"PostDate":1445803585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Has anyone used DJ Encore? He is the only DJ that Juan Carlos can recommend for Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun but I cannot find any reviews on him. I have seen reviews for other DJ's used at our venue but none for their \"house DJ.\" Please feel free to leave any recommendations for other DJ's as well!\u00a0 Our wedding is March 12, 2016 so any help ASAP would be amazing!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kaitlyncrossley@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.210.150.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436600648,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283914.jpg?_r=1440103647","PhotoWidth":188,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Kaitlyncrossley","Id":283914,"Name":"Kaitlyncrossley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79678,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37a94204a13dc5678e1665fa255e8a41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t know anything about the resort but I did a search and found the two links below that will be worth a read. More links came up but too many to post. If you do a search up to under NOW Sapphire DJ you&#039;ll get them to come. Definitely give them a read. Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/66415-official-now-jade-wedding-thread\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/66415-official-now-jade-wedding-thread\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/page-175&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/page-175&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906872,"PostDate":1445980877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I don't know anything about the resort but I did a search and found the two links below that will be worth a read. More links came up but too many to post. If you do a search up to under NOW Sapphire DJ you'll get them to come. Definitely give them a read. Good luck!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/66415-official-now-jade-wedding-thread\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...wedding-thread\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/62152-now-sapphire-weddings-formerly-paradisus-riviera\/page-175' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...iviera\/page-175<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
