{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.59.137.216","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79610,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de97affb23f41105bfcaea3f2ca4d045","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello, everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So I&#039;m still looking around for resorts and have several that I&#039;m interested in, especially the Now Resorts, but I can&#039;t decide between Now Jade or Now Sapphire. I think I really like Now Sapphire so far though. So I was wondering, for any pass or future brides that looked into the resorts or had their wedding there, what is your opinions on the two and what is the difference in amenities, properties, beaches, locations, etc? And how are the weddings there? I can&#039;t set a date yet for my wedding because of some circumstances so I can&#039;t yet get a travel agent or contact resorts, so I thought I would just ask for opinions here :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905260,"PostDate":1443004642,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello, everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So I'm still looking around for resorts and have several that I'm interested in, especially the Now Resorts, but I can't decide between Now Jade or Now Sapphire. I think I really like Now Sapphire so far though. So I was wondering, for any pass or future brides that looked into the resorts or had their wedding there, what is your opinions on the two and what is the difference in amenities, properties, beaches, locations, etc? And how are the weddings there? I can't set a date yet for my wedding because of some circumstances so I can't yet get a travel agent or contact resorts, so I thought I would just ask for opinions here <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrae2958@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"104.59.137.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440007420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284488.jpg?_r=1440023025","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackyrae","Id":284488,"Name":"jackyrae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.163.4.3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79610,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8736348f13fd337791195df5df9ec5c6","RawContent":"So funny you ask this i just went back and forth about this for our upcoming vacation. We decided on Sapphire due to the upcoming construction of the Jade lobby. We&#039;ve been to NOW larimar 2x and had our wedding there in May- hoping the Sapphire is just as nice if not better than the larimar.!! I hope some one is able to give you insight on the two!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1905282,"PostDate":1443023746,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So funny you ask this i just went back and forth about this for our upcoming vacation. We decided on Sapphire due to the upcoming construction of the Jade lobby. We've been to NOW larimar 2x and had our wedding there in May- hoping the Sapphire is just as nice if not better than the larimar.!! I hope some one is able to give you insight on the two!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"May 01, 2015- complete!! 73 guests+bride & groom! Now Larimar Punta Cana! ","Email":"cooper.tyshelle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.50.56.179","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375998669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272393.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DR2015","Id":272393,"Name":"DR2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.13.164.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79610,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0de967b1eb2e8818ab4e3da91a63ac4f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Our wedding is booked at Now Sapphire for next April. We also looked at Jade. So far I have had very good experiences with Sapphire - I love my WC (which many brides cannot say)! We also did a quick site visit (a few hours only) earlier this year and thought it was gorgeous and the food delicious.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For us, Now Jade was a little bit more expensive - but not by a lot. I mainly went with Sapphire because a friend of mine had gotten married there a couple of years ago and was happy with her experience, and also because Sapphire seems to have a more traditional Mexican feel to it, which is what I wanted, while Jade is more modern. But the resorts seem fairly similar, at least on paper.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy to answer any specific questions you might have, at least as best as I can, not having had our wedding yet.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905296,"PostDate":1443038657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Our wedding is booked at Now Sapphire for next April. We also looked at Jade. So far I have had very good experiences with Sapphire - I love my WC (which many brides cannot say)! We also did a quick site visit (a few hours only) earlier this year and thought it was gorgeous and the food delicious.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For us, Now Jade was a little bit more expensive - but not by a lot. I mainly went with Sapphire because a friend of mine had gotten married there a couple of years ago and was happy with her experience, and also because Sapphire seems to have a more traditional Mexican feel to it, which is what I wanted, while Jade is more modern. But the resorts seem fairly similar, at least on paper.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy to answer any specific questions you might have, at least as best as I can, not having had our wedding yet.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Now Sapphire review:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.143.78","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79610,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1443107443,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97e434797001300ed5e462749f1bd33a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community jackyrae and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! You&#039;ll find lots of great ideas, advice, info and support on the boards here, so well done on getting a great start :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll have a truly picturesque wedding venue in either choice - the NOW Jade or NOW Sapphire, so you can exhale....it&#039;s all good :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To show you what we&#039;re talking about, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured at each one....so you can imagine how you Wedding Day Love Story in photos will look........enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153455288424487.1073741940.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Jade Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/11170315_10153455291979487_1861569579814103284_o.jpg\" alt=\"11170315_10153455291979487_1861569579814\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11741091_10153455297229487_7090297919879045525_o.jpg\" alt=\"11741091_10153455297229487_7090297919879\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11411603_10153455297834487_1409039055163978241_o.jpg\" alt=\"11411603_10153455297834487_1409039055163\"&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Sapphire Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/1978584_10152285888034487_1400240025_o.jpg\" alt=\"1978584_10152285888034487_1400240025_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1909431_10152285892349487_154319466_o.jpg\" alt=\"1909431_10152285892349487_154319466_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1978483_10152285893489487_1255196189_o.jpg\" alt=\"1978483_10152285893489487_1255196189_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/1397533_10152285894499487_1919232441_o.jpg\" alt=\"1397533_10152285894499487_1919232441_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905352,"PostDate":1443107330,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community jackyrae and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! You'll find lots of great ideas, advice, info and support on the boards here, so well done on getting a great start <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll have a truly picturesque wedding venue in either choice - the NOW Jade or NOW Sapphire, so you can exhale....it's all good <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To show you what we're talking about, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured at each one....so you can imagine how you Wedding Day Love Story in photos will look........enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153455288424487.1073741940.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Jade Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/11170315_10153455291979487_1861569579814103284_o.jpg\" alt=\"11170315_10153455291979487_1861569579814\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/11741091_10153455297229487_7090297919879045525_o.jpg\" alt=\"11741091_10153455297229487_7090297919879\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11411603_10153455297834487_1409039055163978241_o.jpg\" alt=\"11411603_10153455297834487_1409039055163\"><\/span>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Sapphire Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/1978584_10152285888034487_1400240025_o.jpg\" alt=\"1978584_10152285888034487_1400240025_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1909431_10152285892349487_154319466_o.jpg\" alt=\"1909431_10152285892349487_154319466_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/1978483_10152285893489487_1255196189_o.jpg\" alt=\"1978483_10152285893489487_1255196189_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-dfw1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/1397533_10152285894499487_1919232441_o.jpg\" alt=\"1397533_10152285894499487_1919232441_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
