ist 45 minute set $650\n\nSaxophonist 45 minute set $650\n\nJazz Trio 45 minute set $1,100\n\nPiano 45 minute set $770\n\nTrio 45 minute set $2,800\n\nHarp 45 minute set $900\n\nClassical Trio 45 minute set $1,200\n\nMariachi (6 men playing) 45 minute set $1,100\n\nMariachi (10 men playing) 45 minute set $1,500\n\nDJ services (4 hrs.) $1,000\n\nAdditional DJ hr $350\n\nBand 45 minute set $1,400\n\nSteel Drum 45 minute set $950&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PHOTOGRAPHY AND VIDEOGRAPHY&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nOnline Slideshow free with every wedding\n\nIndividual photos (8x6 prints or image cd\/license) $15 ea&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standard Packages&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 1 $699\n\n1 Hour Coverage (Ceremony + Photo Session) + 40 images on CD&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 2 $950\n\n3 Hours Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party) + 60 images on cd&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 3 $1,150\n\nFull 1 Day Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting) + 100 images on CD&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Standard Photo Package 4 $1,599\n\nComplete Wedding Coverage (rehearsal dinner, spa, getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting, trash the dress) +200 images&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Additional Photographer (per hour) $99&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Luxury Wedding Book\n\n30 layouts 30 pages up to 60 images $699\n\n40 layouts 40 pages up to 80 images $999\n\n60 layouts 60 pages up to 100 images $1,199&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Fine art canvas prints\n\n16x24 fine art canvas print $129\n\n20x30 fine art canvas print $169\n\n24x36 fine art canvas print $199&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complete Wedding Collection&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\n300 images + Luxury Wedding Book with 15 Layouts (40 pages) $1,999&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;300 high resolution images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery, vision art book with 15 layouts (30 pages) &amp;amp; 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,195&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;All your high resolution wedding images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery vision art book with 20 layouts (40 pages) &amp;amp; 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,950&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #1 $590\n\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles.\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. Professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 90 to 120 min. of service. 30 to 40 minutes edited video. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;\u2022 &lt;\/span&gt;Master DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #2 $1,000\n\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles.\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 3 to 4 hours of service. 60 minutes edited video. Master\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;\u2022 &lt;\/span&gt;DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #3 $1,620&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 8 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.\n\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Video Package #4 $2,100\n\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital &amp;amp; special effects, addition, music &amp;amp; titles.\n\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.\n\n\u2022 6 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.\n\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Additional copy of DVD $80\n\nAdditional Hour of Photo Services $280\n\nAdditional Hour of Video Service $280&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PHOTOBOOTH&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Silver $649&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Includes 3 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 100 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Gold $799&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Includes 4 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 215 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;* Additional Hour $165.00 USD. Venue will have to be confirmed at least 3 days prior the event, due to space and weather conditions. Prices don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t include tax and are subject to change&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLOWERS &lt;\/strong&gt;(prices plus 11% tax)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Tropical Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet Selection $80&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Luxury Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $125&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Bouquet Selection $350&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Bridesmaid\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $65&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Corsages (wrist or shoulder) $35&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Corsages $55&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Boutonniere $20&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Boutonniere $45&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Tropical Dinner Centerpieces $65&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Luxury Dinner Centerpieces $85&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Premium Dinner Centerpieces $230&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Ceremony Centerpiece $50&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Columns and Arrangements (2) $180&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Canopy $350&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Flower Wedding Arch $450&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Single Flower $12&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Bag with Petals $15&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Basket with Petals $35&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECORATIONS (Prices plus 16% tax)&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nDance Floor for Reception (2-50 pax) $800.00\n\nDance Floor for Reception (50-100 pax) $1200.00\n\nPaper Luminaries $5.00\n\nTikki torches decoration (6 pieces per event) $150.00\n\nTiffany Chairs $10.00 (Available in white, gold, silver, brown)\n\nBamboo Chairs $10.00\n\nVersalles Chairs Available only in dark brown $10.00\n\nAvant-garde chairs available only in white $15.00\n\nRegular Ribbons for chairs $5.00 (Red, brown, yellow, green, pink, ivory, white, purple, contact your wedding coordinator for special request)\n\nLinen (per table) from $18.00 to $25\n\nTable Overlay (per table) from $18.00 to $25&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Special Color napkin (per pax) $4.00\n\nFans (Castaways restaurant) $150 ( mandatory on April, May, June months)\n\nLight Packages $350&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOTEL PASSES &lt;\/strong&gt;(guests arriving from other properties)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;Day Pass (9:00am-6:00pm) $65 per person\n\nNight Pass (6:00pm-1:00am) $75 per person\n\nFull Pass (9:00am-2:00am) $55 per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:2.25pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;*&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt; Prices are subject to change without prior notice&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595154,"PostDate":1331759377,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Additional Wedding Services (whether ala carte or adding to your package)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>CEREMONY<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Nondenominational Minister $450<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Services of the Judge (Legal) $600 (includes paperwork, judge\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s fees, and marriage license)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Blood test and medical certification (must be paid in cash directly to the doctor) $250<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Certified translation (per sheet) $50<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Tiffany Chairs $10 per chair<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>SET UP<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basic ceremony setup (2-50 guests) $200 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basic ceremony setup (50-100 guests) $300 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basic ceremony setup (101-200 guests) $400 (chairs with white covers and table for judge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Deluxe s ceremony setup (per person) $15(chairs with white covers, bow and flower corsage hanging in back)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Dance floor for reception (2-50 guests) $800<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Dance floor for reception (50-100 guests) $1,200<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>FOOD AND BEVERAGE <\/strong>(prices plus 11% tax and 15% service charge)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Champagne toast (sparkling wine) $4 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Wedding cake $5-8 per person (depending on the design selected)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Hors d\u00e2\u20ac\u2122oeuvres $15 per person per hour (8 pieces per person)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Cocktails $15 per person per hour<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Eternity Dinner $48 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Divine Dinner $53 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Private event at restaurant terrace $500 (this fee is for the location and does NOT include food and service charge.\u00a0 Accommodates 30-50 guests)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>MUSIC (PRICES PLUS 16% TAX)<\/strong><br>\nSound System equipment per event<br>\n1-50 guests $150<br>\n50-150 guests $300<br>\nViolinist 45 minute set $650<br>\nGuitarist 45 minute set $650<br>\nSaxophonist 45 minute set $650<br>\nJazz Trio 45 minute set $1,100<br>\nPiano 45 minute set $770<br>\nTrio 45 minute set $2,800<br>\nHarp 45 minute set $900<br>\nClassical Trio 45 minute set $1,200<br>\nMariachi (6 men playing) 45 minute set $1,100<br>\nMariachi (10 men playing) 45 minute set $1,500<br>\nDJ services (4 hrs.) $1,000<br>\nAdditional DJ hr $350<br>\nBand 45 minute set $1,400<br>\nSteel Drum 45 minute set $950<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>PHOTOGRAPHY AND VIDEOGRAPHY<\/strong><br>\nOnline Slideshow free with every wedding<br>\nIndividual photos (8x6 prints or image cd\/license) $15 ea<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Standard Packages<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 1 $699<br>\n1 Hour Coverage (Ceremony + Photo Session) + 40 images on CD<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 2 $950<br>\n3 Hours Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party) + 60 images on cd<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 3 $1,150<br>\nFull 1 Day Coverage (getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting) + 100 images on CD<\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard Photo Package 4 $1,599<br>\nComplete Wedding Coverage (rehearsal dinner, spa, getting ready, ceremony, photo session, cocktail party, reception, cake cutting, trash the dress) +200 images<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Additional Photographer (per hour) $99<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Luxury Wedding Book<br>\n30 layouts 30 pages up to 60 images $699<br>\n40 layouts 40 pages up to 80 images $999<br>\n60 layouts 60 pages up to 100 images $1,199<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Fine art canvas prints<br>\n16x24 fine art canvas print $129<br>\n20x30 fine art canvas print $169<br>\n24x36 fine art canvas print $199<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>Complete Wedding Collection<\/strong><br>\n300 images + Luxury Wedding Book with 15 Layouts (40 pages) $1,999<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">300 high resolution images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery, vision art book with 15 layouts (30 pages) & 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,195<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">All your high resolution wedding images on disk, online slideshow, online gallery vision art book with 20 layouts (40 pages) & 16x24 fine art canvas print $2,950<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #1 $590<br>\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles.<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. Professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 90 to 120 min. of service. 30 to 40 minutes edited video. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2022 <\/span>Master DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #2 $1,000<br>\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles.<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 3 to 4 hours of service. 60 minutes edited video. Master<br><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2022 <\/span>DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #3 $1,620<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 8 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.<br>\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Video Package #4 $2,100<br>\n\u2022 Ceremony. Video studio by the beach. Includes digital & special effects, addition, music & titles.<br>\n\u2022 Full digital edition. 1 professional digital camera.<br>\n\u2022 6 hours of service. 90 to 120 minutes edited video.<br>\n\u2022 Master DVD with interactive menus.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Additional copy of DVD $80<br>\nAdditional Hour of Photo Services $280<br>\nAdditional Hour of Video Service $280<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>PHOTOBOOTH<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Silver $649<\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Includes 3 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 100 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Gold $799<\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Includes 4 hours of service, photo booth attendee, 215 4x6 prints, party props, DVD of all photos and videos professionally edited, set-up and break-down<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\">* Additional Hour $165.00 USD. Venue will have to be confirmed at least 3 days prior the event, due to space and weather conditions. Prices don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t include tax and are subject to change<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>FLOWERS <\/strong>(prices plus 11% tax)<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Tropical Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet Selection $80<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Luxury Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $125<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Bouquet Selection $350<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Bridesmaid\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $65<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Corsages (wrist or shoulder) $35<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Corsages $55<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Boutonniere $20<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Boutonniere $45<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Tropical Dinner Centerpieces $65<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Luxury Dinner Centerpieces $85<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Premium Dinner Centerpieces $230<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Ceremony Centerpiece $50<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns and Arrangements (2) $180<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Canopy $350<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Flower Wedding Arch $450<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Single Flower $12<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Bag with Petals $15<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Basket with Petals $35<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>DECORATIONS (Prices plus 16% tax)<\/strong><br>\nDance Floor for Reception (2-50 pax) $800.00<br>\nDance Floor for Reception (50-100 pax) $1200.00<br>\nPaper Luminaries $5.00<br>\nTikki torches decoration (6 pieces per event) $150.00<br>\nTiffany Chairs $10.00 (Available in white, gold, silver, brown)<br>\nBamboo Chairs $10.00<br>\nVersalles Chairs Available only in dark brown $10.00<br>\nAvant-garde chairs available only in white $15.00<br>\nRegular Ribbons for chairs $5.00 (Red, brown, yellow, green, pink, ivory, white, purple, contact your wedding coordinator for special request)<br>\nLinen (per table) from $18.00 to $25<br>\nTable Overlay (per table) from $18.00 to $25<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Special Color napkin (per pax) $4.00<br>\nFans (Castaways restaurant) $150 ( mandatory on April, May, June months)<br>\nLight Packages $350<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>HOTEL PASSES <\/strong>(guests arriving from other properties)<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">Day Pass (9:00am-6:00pm) $65 per person<br>\nNight Pass (6:00pm-1:00am) $75 per person<br>\nFull Pass (9:00am-2:00am) $55 per person<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:2.25pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">*<em><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"> Prices are subject to change without prior notice<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~Trisha~<\/p>\n<p>Destination Wedding Photographer & Travel Agent<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com\">www.faberphotography.com<\/a>\u00a0-\u00a0My latest destination wedding photos can be found\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/\">HERE<\/a><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Disney Specialist\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationw